cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference this project, please cite it as below."
title: "Mobile money fraud detection on PaySim"
abstract: >-
  Fraud detection on the PaySim mobile money dataset using walk-forward
  cross-validation, cost-sensitive metrics, and cost-aware class weighting.
  Includes an honest comparison against the legacy rule-based system shipped
  with the dataset.
